{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29223","headline":"寄郴州李相公 · 许浑","name":"寄郴州李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼王与谢，逸韵比南金。\n不遇销忧日，埃尘谁复寻。\n旷怀澹得丧，失意纵登临。\n彩槛浮云迥，绮窗明月深。\n虯龙压沧海，鸳鸯思邓林。\n青云伤国器，白发轸乡心。\n功高恩自洽，道直谤徒侵。\n应笑灵均恨，江畔独行吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}